OL,3,GNEWSAArtist explores 'beautiful mess'
OL,4,Aof motherhood
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn artist who spent years trying to
OL,7,Fhave a baby through IVF has created an
OL,8,Fexhibition exploring motherhood.
OL,10,FEmma Howell, 34, from Cheltenham,
OL,11,FGloucestershire, gave birth to her
OL,12,Fdaughter in February 2025 after what
OL,13,Fshe described as a "gruelling" IVF
OL,14,Fprocess.
OL,16,FHer exhibition, Day after Day, looks at
OL,17,Fthe first 18 months of motherhood
OL,18,Fthrough four seasons: Overstimulation,
OL,19,Fendurance, lessons and becoming.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
